+      a b ha hab m r D q (by omega) hD C (higherBandCarrierAmplitude d r D lam fine)
+      (higherBandCarrierAmplitude_measurable d r D lam fine)
+      (higherBandCarrierAmplitude_cost_integrable d r D lam L T hT fine)
