-    ∂<•highPacketSignedMeasure (cardinalSeparatedMeasure d n T) ad bd m n D q C
-      (cardinalSeparatedAmplitude lam)) -
-    η^2 * (∏ i, p i) * ∑ i, (w i)^2 *
-      highResponseVarianceTerm a V η g w (fun i => highFrameFeature (U i)) c y i
