-    |higherBandCarrierFactor d r lam fine ζ l x| ≤ 1 := by
-  cases fine
-  · exact cardinal_separated_factor_abs_le_one lam ζ l x hx
-  · exact cardinal_band_factor_abs_le_one lam ζ l x hx
