-    historyMarkedAppend_fiber_map, historyShapeReferenceWeight_append,
-    ENNReal.ofReal_mul (historyReferenceRho_pos Δ).le]
-  exact (historyMarkedAppend_measurable dependent hsymm j).aemeasurable
