+              (∑ β : HighFrameIndex d D, |highFrameCoefficients (spatialCardinalPolynomial U i) β|) *
+              (∑ β : HighFrameIndex d D, |highFrameCoefficients (spatialCardinalPolynomial U i) β|) by
