+      (paperDyadicTerminalLevel C (paperUpperSaddle C) (paperUpperShift C) H x : ℝ)) =
+      2 * (Real.log 2 * (paperDyadicTerminalLevel C (paperUpperSaddle C) (paperUpperShift C) H x : ℝ)) := by
+    unfold paperDyadicStep
