-  · rcases hyx.eq_or_eq hyz hzx.le with hzy | hzxEq
-    · exact hzy.symm
-    · exact (hzx.ne hzxEq).elim
-  · rcases hzx.eq_or_eq hzy hyx.le with hyz | hyxEq
-    · exact hyz
-    · exact (hyx.ne hyxEq).elim
