-    ‖PowerSeries.coeff k (combinedSeries lo hi M0 M)‖ ≤
-      2 ^ ((∑ i, dims i) + 1) * ((k + 1 : ℕ) : ℝ) ^ (∑ i, dims i) * intervalRho lo hi ^ k := by
-  rw [combinedSeries_coefficient_eq_addFactors lo hi M0 M hM]
